Optional components
-------------------
Optional OCR, LLM, and privacy features (LangChain, spaCy, ...) are
not bundled. They are installed on demand and are governed by their own
licenses.

PaddleOCR algorithms
--------------------
The built-in reader's text-box post-processing and line cropping re-implement the published
algorithms of PaddleOCR (Apache-2.0, https://github.com/PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR). No PaddleOCR
source code is included in this product. The model files the reader runs are third-party
components; their attribution and license text are in the third-party license report.

